\ Not supported (re-check of the Forth review of small-tactics-1, finding 1):
\ 36 nested by-try around 126 by-iterate weigh 4 (the proof's by) + 36 * 4
\ + 128 = 276 of the runner's bound on Lean's recursion depth, 240
\ (src/front/tactic-run.fs's lf-tac-depth-most): 99 at by-iterate, never
\ accepted. Pinned Lean refuses its twin with "maximum recursion depth has
\ been reached" (rec-depth-wrong.lean's rd_try_36: try (... (iterate 126
\ skip)), 36 deep) and accepts 35 (rec-depth.lean's rd_try_35).
